Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error on the full pool to see if it improves over the simple mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full pool to see if it improves over the mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if robust trimming improves over mean/median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Try a best_single strategy with ETS to see if a single top model beats the mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled meta-model handle w1 on the full pool to see if it improves over the best_single ETS.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the full pool to see if it outperforms the best_single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination using inverse_error on the smaller, high‑performing pool1 to see if focusing on the top models improves over the full‑pool weighted version.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on a different pool (pool2) using inverse_error to see if a more diverse subset improves over the best single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean combination on the smaller, high-performing pool1 to see if restricting to the top models improves over full mean/weighted.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on a different pool (pool2) to see if it beats the current best single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the smaller robust pool (pool1) using the existing handle w1 to see if restricting to strong models improves over the full‑pool weighted version.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"w1"}

